[00:51.50] This unrest beats out my breath
[01:00.68] Disconnected thoughts jangle in a mess
[01:12.17] This unrest crucifies my chest
[01:26.42] Without anaesthetic it cuts
[01:39.43] Through tumorous flesh
[01:46.92] This unrest beats out my breath ...
[01:58.61] This unrest beats in my chest
[02:39.09] Discordant limbs watch unimpressed
[02:52.71] At the aimless walk the mindless talk
[02:58.13] The pictures leap out and dance for me
[03:03.07] They laugh at me
[03:49.75] As your bitterness closes in
[03:55.12] You're feeling very old again
[04:00.92] Ah just to sleep, without these thoughts
[04:06.28] But the angels shout, resurrecting doubt
[04:12.89] Ah we meet again, my trusty friend
[04:23.90] Demanding new favours for old time's sake
[04:32.83] Inside this captive frame
[04:42.86] Come and claim your liberty
[05:02.16] Metal and flesh will fuse today
[05:05.79] These visions jump out and blast my days
[05:09.12] Clean away ...
[05:22.68] 